OL,3,A'High risk' of lake breaching and
OL,4,Acausing second flood, warns China
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs of Friday, an estimated 2.5 million
OL,7,Fcubic metres of water had accumulated,
OL,8,Faccording to broadcaster CCTV.
OL,9,FOfficials said that three million cubic
OL,10,Fmetres of water is expected to flow
OL,11,Finto the lake between Thursday and the
OL,12,Fweekend, posing a "high risk of
OL,13,Fbreach".
OL,15,FBut experts have told the BBC that it
OL,16,Fis possible that the lake could drain
OL,17,Fout naturally over time.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
